1
00:00:00,015 --> 00:00:01,985
(Leonard:)It's hard to believe
Howard's having a kid.

2
00:00:01,984 --> 00:00:03,314
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

3
00:00:03,319 --> 00:00:05,389
(Amy:)Penny, you're the one who
introduced him to Bernie.

4
00:00:05,387 --> 00:00:07,887
(Penny:)How many times do I have
to say I'm sorry?

5
00:00:09,091 --> 00:00:11,361
(Leonard:)It's not just Howard
and Bernadette. I mean,

6
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,090
(Leonard:)look how far
we've all come.

7
00:00:13,095 --> 00:00:14,025
(Stuart:)Hmm.
Hmm.

8
00:00:14,029 --> 00:00:15,299
(Stuart:)You two got married.

9
00:00:15,297 --> 00:00:17,827
(Amy:)Sheldon and I
are living together.

10
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:20,403
(Sheldon:)But if my mom asks,
we have bunk beds.

11
00:00:22,171 --> 00:00:24,471
(Leonard:)Penny was a struggling
actress when we met,

12
00:00:24,473 --> 00:00:26,703
(Leonard:)and now she's a successful
pharmaceutical rep.

13
00:00:26,709 --> 00:00:29,309
(Penny:)Okay, you don't have to say
“struggling” every time.

14
00:00:29,311 --> 00:00:31,981
You can just say “actress.”

15
00:00:31,981 --> 00:00:33,881
(Stuart:)Howard went to space.

16
00:00:33,883 --> 00:00:36,153
(Amy:)Bernadette got
her doctorate.

17
00:00:36,151 --> 00:00:38,351
(Leonard:)Sheldon, Howard and I are
working with the government

18
00:00:38,354 --> 00:00:40,024
(Leonard:)on our quantum gyroscope.

19
00:00:40,022 --> 00:00:42,292
(Amy:)We've all come a long way.

20
00:00:42,291 --> 00:00:43,821
(Amy:)There's a lot
to be proud of.

21
00:00:45,261 --> 00:00:48,931
(Raj:)For God's sake, just drive in
the knife, why don't you!

22
00:00:50,833 --> 00:00:52,903
(Stuart:)What's your problem?
Well, you're all thinking

23
00:00:52,902 --> 00:00:56,272
that I'm the only one who
hasn't done anything worthwhile.

24
00:00:56,272 --> 00:00:57,742
(Sheldon:)I was not thinking it.

25
00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:01,980
(Sheldon:)Although, now that
you point it out, it is undeniable.

